&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll plan your day (and life)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We work async at Remote which means you can plan your schedule around your life (and not around meetings). Read more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;remote.com/async&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will be empowered to take ownership and be proactive. When in doubt you will default to action instead of waiting. Your &lt;strong&gt;life-work balance&lt;/strong&gt; is important and you will be encouraged to put yourself and your family first, and fit work around your needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If that sounds like something you want, apply now!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please fill out the form below and upload your CV with a PDF format.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;We kindly ask you to submit your application and CV in English, as this is the standardised language we use here at Remote.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you don’t have an up to date CV but you are still interested in talking to us, please feel free to add a copy of your LinkedIn profile instead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Not only do we encourage folks from all ethnic groups, genders, sexuality, age, abilities, disability status and any other under-represented group to apply, but we prioritize a sense of belonging. We have 4 ERGs (Women, Disability, Queer, Minorities in Tech) who meet regularly with the People team. During your interviews and beyond, we ask &amp;amp; encourage anybody who needs an accommodation to request one from their recruiter.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We will ask you to voluntarily tell us your pronouns at interview stage, and you will have the option to answer our anonymous demographic questionnaire when you apply below. As an equal employment opportunity employer it’s important to us that our workforce reflects people of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences and this data will help us to stay accountable. We thank you for providing this data, if you chose to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Remote, we embrace AI as a valuable tool while prioritizing human creativity and authenticity.&amp;nbsp;We look forward to meeting candidates who balance innovation with genuine expertise and experience.&amp;nbsp;To learn more about Remote&#39;s AI guidelines check see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Guidelines-on-using-AI-when-applying-for-a-job-at-Remote-11ccb4dadab4805f80a7c73b6567bd8f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Guidelines-on-using-AI-when-applying-for-a-job-at-Remote-11ccb4dadab4805f80a7c73b6567bd8f&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1733927526443000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sIVooKuyGfRra1PtGXreV&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note we accept applications on an ongoing basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Remote is solving modern organizations’ biggest challenge – navigating global employment compliantly with ease. We make it possible for businesses of all sizes to recruit, pay, and manage international teams. With our core values at heart and future focused work culture, our team works tirelessly on ambitious problems, asynchronously, around the world. You can find Remoters working from 6 different continents (Antarctica left to go!) and all of our positions are fully remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-2f7cb4da-dab4-8068-a80f-001c50b2d808 suggestion-update notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;With Innovation as one of the core values, we have built Automation and AI capabilities into the requirements for every role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage every member of the Remote team to bring their talents, experiences and culture to the table to help us build the best-in-class HR platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are energetic, curious, motivated and ambitious, be part of our world. Apply now and define the future of work!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What this job can offer you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting time to join Remote and make a personal difference in the global employment space as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Sales - Account Management (Existing Customer Expansion)&lt;/strong&gt;, joining our &lt;strong&gt;Global Expansion team within the Go-To-Market (GTM) organization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead a high-performing team of Senior Account Managers responsible for growing and retaining our Mid-Market and Enterprise customer base across EMEA. You&#39;ll own the daily operating rhythm of the business—forecasting, coaching, deal strategy, and execution—while creating an environment where people are challenged, supported, and inspired to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires more than commercial excellence. We&#39;re looking for a leader who develops people, builds strong cross-functional partnerships, and creates momentum during periods of change. You recognize problems quickly—but more importantly, you help teams solve them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in Account Management or Existing Business leadership, ideally within Mid-Market and Enterprise segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading quota-carrying sales teams with responsibility for forecasting, pipeline management, performance coaching, and revenue attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to develop high-performing Account Managers through coaching, feedback, and structured development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as a hands-on leader—jumping into strategic customer conversations, negotiations, and deal coaching when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong forecasting discipline with the ability to identify risks, opportunities, and trends early through data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining, measuring, and presenting sales metrics and business performance to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of driving pipeline rigor, operational excellence, and predictable revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce and modern sales technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English; additional European languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine coaching mindset with a passion for helping others grow and succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trust quickly and develops strong partnerships across Product, RevOps, Customer Success, Acquisition Sales, Marketing, Finance, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and leading confidently through change, helping others stay focused on execution rather than uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally optimistic and solutions-oriented. You raise risks thoughtfully, challenge ideas constructively, and instinctively pair problems with practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates positive energy within teams. You elevate the people around you through collaboration, accountability, and encouragement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Takes ownership beyond your immediate team, proactively identifying opportunities to improve how the broader organization operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Celebrates team success over individual recognition and contributes positively to the broader leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently delivers strong business outcomes while building a healthy, sustainable, and high-performing team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the daily operating rhythm of the Account Management team through effective pipeline reviews, forecast calls, one-on-ones, deal coaching, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed team revenue goals while developing a high-performing organization capable of sustained success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and empower Senior Account Managers to maximize customer value, improve commercial execution, and grow in their careers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the business by supporting strategic negotiations, joining key customer conversations, and helping remove obstacles that accelerate deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of accountability, ownership, and continuous improvement where high standards and strong support coexist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a solutions-first mindset by helping the team confront difficult challenges honestly, identify practical paths forward, and execute with urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve sales processes, operational efficiency, and customer outcomes across the broader Existing Business organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted partnerships with Product, RevOps, Customer Success, Finance, Marketing, and Acquisition Sales to improve customer experience and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistent forecasting accuracy, pipeline hygiene, account prioritization, and sales execution across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly analyze business performance to identify trends, risks, opportunities, and actionable insights for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide weekly, monthly, and quarterly reporting on pipeline health, forecast accuracy, customer expansion, wins, losses, and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a team culture where collaboration, curiosity, resilience, and continuous learning are expected and celebrated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a role model for Remote&#39;s values by creating alignment, building trust, and helping the broader organization succeed—not just your own team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practical&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP, Expansion Revenue &lt;em&gt;(interim, pending broader Existing Business organizational changes)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Global Expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Region:&lt;/strong&gt; EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; M4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;typography__Body-iwFwvd sc-dSkthi cXuUbj cSFNNz&quot; data-library=&quot;birch&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote&#39;s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/people-Total-Rewards-1945bce8d3924ece9421ba8630f57b0c&quot;&gt;Total Rewards philosophy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;is to ensure fair, unbiased compensation and fair&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1691622878&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-level-1 discussion-id-f2a82bc4-09e4-4a71-ad93-755b1d26a690 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;pay&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;along with competitive benefits in all locations in which we operate. We do not agree to or encourage cheap-labor practices and therefore we ensure to pay above in-location rates. We hope to inspire other companies to support global talent-hiring and bring local wealth to developing countries.&lt;/p&gt;
