&lt;p&gt;The Core Platform team builds the foundational services that power every experience across Lightning AI. From authentication and APIs to multi-tenancy, resource management, and developer tooling, this team creates the platform capabilities that every customer and engineering team depends on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Software Engineer to help design, build, and scale these core systems. You&#39;ll work on backend services that support researchers, startups, and enterprise AI teams as they build, train, and deploy AI applications on Lightning AI. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with product, infrastructure, and AI engineering teams to improve reliability, scalability, and developer experience across the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in one of our San Francisco, NYC, or London office hubs, with a minimum of 2 in-office days per week and occasional team and company offsites. We are not able to provide visa sponsorship for this position at this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable backend services powering Lightning AI Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop APIs and platform services supporting authentication, resource management, multi-tenancy, and developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve reliability, observability, scalability, and performance across core platform infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product, infrastructure, and AI engineering teams to deliver new platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and improve technical architecture, engineering processes, and operational tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and help establish engineering best practices across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience building scalable backend systems using Go, Python, Rust, React or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and operating distributed systems or cloud-native services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building APIs, platform services, and infrastructure that other engineers depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes, Docker, and modern cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of software quality, automated testing, observability, and continuous delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead technical initiatives from architecture through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively across engineering, product, and design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-moving, ambiguous startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
